  "body": "As noted at https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4415#issuecomment-470543670 platform object is defined for ECMAScript objects, not IDL objects. We frequently reference state hold by ECMAScript objects as if it was hold on IDL objects. That needs sorting somehow.\r\n\r\ncc @domenic @Ms2ger ",
